#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:19
msgid "Tube Settler Design"
msgstr "Diseño de sedimentadores tubulares"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:21
msgid ""
"Design a tube settler for a laboratory scale clarifier. The vertical section"
" of the clarifier, :math:`v_{z_{ff}}`, has a net upflow velocity of 3 mm/s. "
"This velocity is maintained in the tube settler, :math:`v_{\\alpha}`. The "
"target capture velocity is 0.2 mm/s. The tube settler diameter is 2.54 cm."
msgstr ""
"Diseña un estabilizador de tubos para un clarificador a escala de "
"laboratorio. La sección vertical del clarificador, :math:`v_{z_{ff}}`, tiene"
" una velocidad neta de flujo ascendente de 3 mm/s. Esta velocidad se "
"mantiene en el sedimentador de tubos, :math:`v_{\\alpha}`. La velocidad de "
"captura del objetivo es de 0,2 mm/s. El diámetro del decantador de tubos es "
"de 2,54 cm."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:23
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\bar v_{z_{ff}}}{\\bar v_c} = \\frac{L}{D} \\cos \\alpha \\sin "
"\\alpha + \\sin ^2 \\alpha\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:25
msgid ""
"\\bar v_{z_{ff}} = \\bar v_\\alpha\\sin \\alpha\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\bar v_{z_{ff}} = \\bar v_\\alpha\\sin \\alpha\n"
"\n"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Solve for the length of the tube settler. "
"<https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1lE7cHu3TS1vMs0_yA3FmNdPnk3iktBJw#scrollTo=qxeWciqaZnPZ&line=4&uniqifier=1>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Resuelve la longitud del sedimentador tubular. "
"<https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1lE7cHu3TS1vMs0_yA3FmNdPnk3iktBJw#scrollTo=qxeWciqaZnPZ&line=4&uniqifier=1>`_"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:29
msgid ""
"L = \\frac{D}{\\cos \\alpha}\\left(\\frac{\\bar v_\\alpha}{\\bar v_c} - "
"\\sin \\alpha\\right)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:32
msgid ""
"The tube settler above the floc hopper needs to be 72 cm long. The tube "
"settler should provide a capture velocity of at least 1 mm/s prior to the "
"floc hopper. Thus there should be 11 cm below the floc hopper."
msgstr ""
"El sedimentador tubular sobre el tolva de lodos debe medir 72 cm de largo. "
"El sedimentador tubular debe proporcionar una velocidad de captura de al "
"menos 1 mm/s antes del tolva de lodos. Por tanto, debe haber 11 cm por "
"debajo del tolva de lodos."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:37
msgid "Determining flow through a diffuser"
msgstr "Determinación del flujo a través de un difusor"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:39
msgid ""
"What is the flow rate of a single diffuser in the bottom of the clarifier? "
"Consider a clarifier that is 6 m long, 1 m wide and 2 m deep, with an upflow"
" velocity of 1 mm/s and a diffuser spacing of 5 cm."
msgstr ""
"¿Cuál es la caudal de un solo difusor en la parte inferior del clarificador?"
" Consideremos un clarificador de 6 m de largo, 1 m de ancho y 2 m de "
"profundidad, con una velocidad de flujo ascendente de 1 mm/s y un "
"espaciamiento del difusor de 5 cm."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:41
msgid ""
"What is this question really asking? This question is asking us to "
"understand that each diffuser \"serves\" a specific cross-sectional area of "
"the clarifier; all of the diffusers together serve the entire area of the "
"clarifier. So, let's imagine a single diffuser serving a slice of a "
"clarifier. With this in mind, we can easily solve this using :math:`Q = "
"\\bar vA`. The area, :math:`A`, is the slice of the clarifier that we are "
"serving. We are told that the tank is 1 m wide, so :math:`W_{tank} = 1` m. "
"The length of the slice is dictated by the spacing of the diffusers, "
":math:`B_{diff}`, so :math:`B_{diff} = 5` cm."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué es lo que realmente pregunta esta pregunta? Esta pregunta nos pide "
"entender que cada difusor \"sirve\" a una sección transversal específica del"
" clarificador; todos los difusores juntos cubren toda el área del "
"clarificador. Así que, imaginemos que un solo difusor sirve a una porción de"
" un clarificador. Con esto en mente, podemos resolver esto fácilmente usando"
" :math:`Q = \\bar vA`. El área, :math:`A`, es la porción del clarificador "
"que estamos sirviendo. Nos dicen que el tanque tiene 1 m de ancho, es decir,"
" :math:`W_{tank} = 1` m. La longitud de la rebanada está dictada por el "
"espacio entre los difusores, :math:`B_{diff}`, es decir, :math:`B_{diff} = "
"5` cm."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:43
msgid ""
"A = B_{diff}W_{tank}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"A = B_{diff}W_{tank}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:45
msgid ""
"A = 5 cm * 1 m\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:47
msgid ""
"A = 50,000 mm^2\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:49
msgid ""
"The problem statement includes that :math:`\\bar v_{z_{ff}} = 1` mm/s. "
"Plugging into our flow equation,"
msgstr ""
"La declaración del problema incluye que :math:`\\bar v_{z_{ff}} = 1` mm/s. "
"Introduciendo en nuestra ecuación de flujo,"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:51
msgid ""
"Q_{diff} = \\bar v_{z_{ff}}A\n"
"\n"
msgstr "Q_{diff} = \\bar v_{z_{ff}}A"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:53
msgid ""
"Q_{diff} = (1 \\frac{mm}{s})(50,000mm^2)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:55
msgid ""
"Q_{diff} = 50,000 \\frac{mm^3}{s}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:57
msgid ""
"Q_{diff} = 50 \\frac{mL}{s}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:59
msgid "The flow rate of each diffuser is :math:`50 \\frac{mL}{s}`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:62
msgid "Identify Failure Modes from Old Design"
msgstr "Identificar modos de fallo a partir del diseño antiguo"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:64
msgid ""
"Look at a proposed design for the bottom of the clarifier, shown in "
":numref:`figure_failure_mode_example`. This design has an influent manifold "
"at the bottom of the tank. Water flows upwards from the influent manifold. "
"At one end of the influent manifold, there is a drain port. Above the "
"influent manifold, there is a single slot that extends the length of the "
"clarifier. There are no diffusers in this design."
msgstr ""
"Mira un diseño propuesto para la parte inferior del clarificador, mostrado "
"en :numref:`figure_failure_mode_example`. Este diseño tiene un colector "
"influente en la parte inferior del tanque. El agua fluye hacia arriba desde "
"el colector influyente. En un extremo del colector influyente hay un puerto "
"de drenaje. Encima del colector influyente, hay una única ranura que se "
"extiende a lo largo del clarificador. No hay difusores en este diseño."

