#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:154
msgid ""
"The same principle as above can be applied to this question except the "
"length scale is the width of the clarifier and the velocity is the upwards "
"velocity in the tank."
msgstr ""
"El mismo principio anterior puede aplicarse a esta cuestión, excepto que la "
"escala de longitud es el ancho del clarificador y la velocidad es la "
"velocidad ascendente en el tanque."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:156
msgid ":math:`Re = \\frac{\\bar v_{z_{ff}} W_{sed}}{\\nu}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:158
msgid ""
"**Answer:** Reynolds number through floc is 938.2 dimensionless. These two "
"Reynold's numbers are similar because conservation of mass requires for a "
"constant length that :math:`\\bar v_{1}*W_{1} = \\bar v_{2}*W_{2}`. The "
"slight difference in the numbers is due to that fact that diffusers are not "
"a continuous line jet but rather broken up by two times the thickness of the"
" pipe wall between the diffusers."
msgstr ""
"**Respuesta:** El número de Reynolds a la flócula es 938,2 adimensional. "
"Estos dos números de Reynolds son similares porque la conservación de la "
"masa requiere una longitud constante que :math:`\\bar v_{1}*W_{1} = \\bar "
"v_{2}*W_{2}`. La ligera diferencia en los números se debe a que los "
"difusores no son un chorro de línea continua, sino que se descomponen por el"
" doble de grosor de la pared de la tubería entre los difusores."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:160
msgid ""
"Next, we want to determine the energy dissipation rate for the flow leaving "
"the jet reverser. For this process, you can assume that the jet remains "
"laminar. The flow spreads to fill the gaps created by the walls of the "
"diffuser tubes by the time it traverses the jet reverser. Jet velocity and "
"flow rate are conserved as the jet changes direction in the jet reverser."
msgstr ""
"A continuación, queremos determinar la tasa de disipación de energía para el"
" flujo que sale del inversor del chorro. Para este proceso, se puede suponer"
" que el chorro permanece laminar. El flujo se extiende para rellenar los "
"huecos creados por las paredes de los tubos difusores cuando atraviesa el "
"inversor del chorro. La velocidad del chorro y caudal se conservan a medida "
"que el chorro cambia de dirección en el inversor del chorro."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:162
msgid ""
"7. Calculate the thickness of the jet after it does the 180 degree bend of "
"the jet reverser. < The change in thickness of the jet after the 180 degree "
"bend is due to the flow spreading out to fill in the gaps created by the "
"diffuser pipe walls. :math:`W_{jet} * \\bar v_{diff} = W_{sed} * \\bar "
"v_{z_{ff}}`"
msgstr ""
"7. Calcular el grosor del chorro después de que haga la curvatura de 180 "
"grados del inversor del chorro.< The change in thickness of the jet after "
"the 180 degree bend is due to the flow spreading out to fill in the gaps "
"created by the diffuser pipe walls. :math:`W_{jet} * \\bar v_{diff} = "
"W_{sed} * \\bar v_{z_{ff}}`"

