#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:169
msgid ""
"In designing AguaClara plants, it is critical to account for all forms of "
"significant head loss. In the clarifier, effluent launders provide about 4 "
"cm of head loss. We want to calculate the exit head loss for water leaving "
"the diffusers to determine whether it is a significant addition to the total"
" head loss through the clarifier."
msgstr ""
"Al diseñar plantas AguaClara, es fundamental tener en cuenta todas las "
"formas de pérdida de carga significativas. En el clarificador, los lavados "
"de efluentes proporcionan unos 4 cm de pérdida de carga. Queremos calcular "
"el pérdida de carga de salida del agua que sale de los difusores para "
"determinar si supone una adición significativa a la pérdida de carga total a"
" través del clarificador."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:171
msgid "Calculate the diffuser exit head loss in two ways."
msgstr "Calcula la salida del difusor pérdida de carga de dos maneras."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:173
msgid ""
"First, calculate the head loss making sure to account for the upflow "
"velocity in the clarifier."
msgstr ""
"Primero, calcula la pérdida de carga asegurándote de tener en cuenta la "
"velocidad de flujo ascendente en el clarificador."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:175
msgid ""
":math:`h_e = \\frac{\\left( {{\\bar v_{diff}} - {\\bar v_{z_{ff}}}} "
"\\right)^2}{2g}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:177
msgid ""
"Second, calculate the head loss but assume that the upflow velocity is "
"negligible."
msgstr ""
"Segundo, calcular la pérdida de carga pero asumir que la velocidad de flujo "
"ascendente es despreciable."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:179
msgid ":math:`h_e = \\frac{\\ {\\bar v_{diff}}^2}{2g}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:181
msgid ""
"`Is it reasonable to neglect the upflow velocity in the clarifier when "
"calculating this head loss? "
"<https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1lE7cHu3TS1vMs0_yA3FmNdPnk3iktBJw#scrollTo=mT6cY0pGbzKt&line=1&uniqifier=1>`_"
msgstr ""
"`¿Es razonable descuidar la velocidad de flujo ascendente en el clarificador"
" al calcular esta pérdida de carga? "
"<https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1lE7cHu3TS1vMs0_yA3FmNdPnk3iktBJw#scrollTo=mT6cY0pGbzKt&line=1&uniqifier=1>`_"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:183
msgid ""
"**Answer:** The best estimate of the exit head loss for the diffuser is "
"0.6176 centimeter. The 2nd estimate of the exit head loss for the diffuser "
"ignoring the upflow velocity is 0.6211 centimeter. It is reasonable to "
"neglect the effect of the upflow velocity. The error is 0.005755 "
"dimensionless"
msgstr ""
"**Answer:** La mejor estimación del pérdida de carga de salida para el "
"difusor es 0.6176 centímetro. La estimación 2nd del pérdida de carga de "
"salida para el difusor, ignorando la velocidad de flujo ascendente, es "
"0.6211 centímetro. Es razonable descuidar el efecto de la velocidad de "
"flujo. El error es adimensional 0.005755"

