#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:189
msgid ""
"The following variable definitions and equations will be useful in answering"
" later questions."
msgstr ""
"Las siguientes definiciones de variables y ecuaciones serán útiles para "
"responder preguntas posteriores."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:191
msgid ""
"Determine the relationship between diffuser exit velocity and the head loss "
"in the parallel paths."
msgstr ""
"Determinar la relación entre la velocidad de salida del difusor y la pérdida"
" de carga en las trayectorias paralelas."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:193
msgid ""
":math:`{h}_{L,ParallelPath}` is the head loss (flow resistance) in the "
"parallel paths leaving the manifold. The head loss in the parallel path is "
"the total head loss from where the flow leaves the manifold to the point "
"where the parallel flows reunite."
msgstr ""
":math:`{h}_{L,ParallelPath}` es la pérdida de carga (resistencia del flujo) "
"en los caminos paralelos que salen de la variedad. La pérdida de carga en la"
" trayectoria paralela es la pérdida de carga total desde donde el flujo sale"
" de la variedad hasta el punto donde los flujos paralelos se reúnen."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:195
msgid ""
":math:`\\Delta{H}_{Manifold}` is the variability in piezometric head in the "
"manifold that is driving the flow through the parallel paths."
msgstr ""
":math:`\\Delta{H}_{Manifold}` es la variabilidad en la cabeza piezométrica "
"en la variedad que impulsa el flujo a través de los caminos paralelos."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:197
msgid ""
"The ratio of minimum (first diffuser port) to maximum (last diffuser port) "
"flow is given by:"
msgstr ""
"La proporción entre el flujo mínimo (primer puerto difusor) y el máximo "
"(último puerto difusor) está dada por:"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:199
msgid ""
"\\Pi_{DiffuserFlow} = \\sqrt{\\frac{h_{L,parallelpath} - "
"\\frac{\\Delta{H}_{Manifold}}{2}}{h_{L,parallelpath} + "
"\\frac{\\Delta{H}_{Manifold}}{2}}}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:201
msgid ""
"The change in piezometric head is given by: :math:`\\Delta{H}_{Manifold} = "
"\\frac{{v_{manifold}}^{2}}{2g}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:203
msgid "The maximum allowable velocity in the manifold is given by:"
msgstr "La velocidad máxima permitida en la variedad está dada por:"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:205
msgid ""
"{\\Pi_{DiffuserFlow}}^{2} * \\left(h_{L,parallelpath} + "
"\\frac{\\Delta{H}_{Manifold}}{2} \\right) = h_{L,parallelpath} - "
"\\frac{\\Delta{H}_{Manifold}}{2}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:207
msgid ""
"\\left({\\Pi_{DiffuserFlow}}^{2} - 1 \\right) h_{L,parallelpath} + "
"\\left({\\Pi{DiffuserFlow}}^{2} + 1 \\right) "
"\\frac{\\Delta{H}_{Manifold}}{2} = 0\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:209
msgid ""
"\\left(\\frac{1 - {\\Pi_{DiffuserFlow}}^{2}}{{\\Pi_{DiffuserFlow}}^{2} + 1} "
"\\right) h_{L,parallelpath} = \\frac{\\Delta{H}_{Manifold}}{2}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Examples.rst:211
msgid ""
"\\left(\\frac{1 - {\\Pi_{DiffuserFlow}}^{2}}{{\\Pi_{DiffuserFlow}}^{2} + 1} "
"\\right) h_{L,parallelpath} = \\frac{{v_{manifold}}^{2}}{4g}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

